Context: Project

Purpose:
  Stores context map and active context instances for the current project.
  This file provides routing only — concrete data is generated per project.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @map.sdd
   2  @active.sdd

Modes:
  TASK     — task-specific context
  INCIDENT — incident-specific context
  SECURITY — security-specific context
  MANAGER  — manager/status context
  DEVELOPER — developer/implementation context

Rules:
  [PC1]  Project context MUST follow root context policy.
  [PC2]  Context budget MUST respect project level.
  [PC3]  Context MUST be invalidated on source changes.
  [PC4]  Context audit MUST be recorded for every session.
  [PC5]  Context efficiency target: > 80%.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd

  Resolve:
    map
    active

Navigation:
  ProjectContext: @project/context/INDEX.sdd
  ContextMap: @project/context/map.sdd
  ActiveContext: @project/context/active.sdd
  RootContext: @../context/INDEX.sdd

State: +

Note:
  This file is the project-specific context router. Concrete context
  instances are generated per project by the project-structure skill.
